    "purpose": "Cyber-fraud MO playbook library (crime-script representation, Cornish 1994; structure modelled on MITRE Attack Flow's staged behavior sequencing). Sources for the staged patterns (verified 2026-09-06): I4C 'Digital Arrest' advisory (Mar 2025, i4c.mha.gov.in/advisories.aspx), NITI Aayog 'Digital Arrest: The Modern-Day Cyber Scam' (Apr 2025), NCRP-reported investment/task-fraud pattern. Detectors are regex fragments over normalized text, transactions, and event transcripts — extend via this file only, never in code.",
